{
 "format": "protocol-import-v1",
 "source": {
  "kind": "md",
  "filename": "PE_bead_confocal_experiments.md"
 },
 "protocol": {
  "id": "pe-ax-09-backgrounds",
  "title": "PE beads · Exp 09 · Backgrounds and the real detection floor",
  "summary": "Measure free PE-antibody background and the bead excluded-volume term, bead autofluorescence, and nonspecific PE binding in each imaging mode.",
  "category": "imaging",
  "tags": [
   "pe-beads",
   "confocal",
   "ax-r",
   "characterization",
   "exp-09",
   "background",
   "lod",
   "nonspecific-binding",
   "autofluorescence"
  ],
  "tree": {
   "meta": {},
   "sections": [
    {
     "label": "Overview",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "docHeader",
       "body": "Photon noise alone allows ≈65 PE per bead at 2 µW (washed); the real floor is set here.",
       "attrs": {
        "brand": "",
        "title": "Backgrounds and the detection floor",
        "chips": [
         {
          "text": "Exp 09 of 13"
         },
         {
          "text": "≈3 h plus incubation"
         },
         {
          "text": "Calibration block"
         }
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "kind": "callout",
       "body": "Pins: the effective detection volume per mode and the excluded-volume correction for no-wash reads (9a), bead autofluorescence (9b), and nonspecific PE binding with its bead-to-bead SD, the practical LOD (9c).",
       "attrs": {
        "type": "note"
       }
      },
      {
       "kind": "table",
       "body": "Model predictions (10 µW, 2 µs, 20 px per bead)",
       "attrs": {
        "columns": [
         {
          "key": "mode",
          "label": "Mode",
          "align": "left",
          "mono": false
         },
         {
          "key": "veff",
          "label": "V_eff",
          "align": "left",
          "mono": false
         },
         {
          "key": "lod0",
          "label": "LOD, detector only",
          "align": "left",
          "mono": false
         },
         {
          "key": "lod1",
          "label": "LOD at 1 nM free PE-Ab",
          "align": "left",
          "mono": false
         }
        ],
        "rows": [
         {
          "mode": "20x, 1 AU",
          "veff": "0.53 µm³",
          "lod0": "16 PE/bead",
          "lod1": "106 PE/bead"
         },
         {
          "mode": "10x, 1 AU",
          "veff": "3.7 µm³",
          "lod0": "21 PE/bead",
          "lod1": "139 PE/bead"
         },
         {
          "mode": "10x, 4 AU",
          "veff": "11.2 µm³",
          "lod0": "14 PE/bead",
          "lod1": "158 PE/bead"
         }
        ]
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "label": "Materials",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "materials",
       "attrs": {
        "rows": [
         {
          "qty": "6",
          "unit": "well",
          "free_text": "Blank beads (capture antibody, no analyte) in free PE-antibody: 0, 0.1, 0.3, 1, 3, 10 nM, no wash (9a)",
          "item_ref": null
         },
         {
          "qty": "1",
          "unit": "well",
          "free_text": "Uncoated or BSA-blocked beads in PBS (9b)",
          "item_ref": null
         },
         {
          "qty": "24",
          "unit": "well",
          "free_text": "Capture beads + PE-antibody, no analyte, full washed protocol, at 0.5, 1, 2 and 5 × K_D2, 6 wells each (9c)",
          "item_ref": null
         },
         {
          "qty": "3",
          "unit": "well",
          "free_text": "Same as 9c, unwashed (only if a no-wash format is planned)",
          "item_ref": null
         },
         {
          "qty": "",
          "unit": "",
          "free_text": "PE-detection antibody stock; PBS; #1.5 glass-bottom plate",
          "item_ref": null
         }
        ]
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "label": "Calculators",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "calculator",
       "attrs": {
        "label": "PE-antibody working dilutions",
        "inputs": [
         {
          "name": "stock_ugml",
          "label": "Stock concentration",
          "widget": "number",
          "unit": "µg/mL",
          "default": 100
         },
         {
          "name": "mw_kda",
          "label": "Conjugate molecular weight",
          "widget": "number",
          "unit": "kDa",
          "default": 390,
          "rangeHint": "R-PE 240 + IgG 150"
         },
         {
          "name": "work_nm",
          "label": "Working dilution",
          "widget": "number",
          "unit": "nM",
          "default": 10
         },
         {
          "name": "work_vol_ul",
          "label": "Working dilution volume",
          "widget": "number",
          "unit": "µL",
          "default": 1000
         },
         {
          "name": "final_ul",
          "label": "Volume per well",
          "widget": "number",
          "unit": "µL",
          "default": 200
         }
        ],
        "outputs": [
         {
          "name": "stock_nm",
          "label": "Stock molarity",
          "expr": "stock_ugml * 1000 / mw_kda",
          "unit": "nM",
          "decimals": 1
         },
         {
          "name": "work_stock_ul",
          "label": "Stock into the working dilution",
          "expr": "work_nm * work_vol_ul / stock_nm",
          "unit": "µL",
          "decimals": 1
         }
        ],
        "table": {
         "dataset": "",
         "columns": []
        }
       }
      },
      {
       "kind": "builder",
       "attrs": {
        "label": "Free PE-antibody series (press Add all)",
        "description": "Wells up to 1 nM draw from the [!var:work_nm] working dilution; 3 and 10 nM draw from the stock.",
        "dataset": "pe_series",
        "params": [],
        "dims": [
         {
          "field": "conc",
          "label": "Free PE-Ab (nM)",
          "source": "list",
          "options": [
           "0",
           "0.1",
           "0.3",
           "1",
           "3",
           "10"
          ],
          "editable": true
         }
        ],
        "derived": [
         {
          "field": "source",
          "expr": "conc <= 1 ? \"working\" : \"stock\""
         },
         {
          "field": "pipette_ul",
          "expr": "conc <= 1 ? conc * final_ul / work_nm : conc * final_ul / stock_nm"
         },
         {
          "field": "buffer_ul",
          "expr": "final_ul - pipette_ul"
         }
        ],
        "dedupe": {
         "when": "",
         "ignore": []
        }
       }
      },
      {
       "kind": "calculator",
       "attrs": {
        "label": "Pipetting table",
        "inputs": [],
        "outputs": [],
        "table": {
         "dataset": "pe_series",
         "columns": [
          {
           "label": "Free PE-Ab (nM)",
           "expr": "conc",
           "align": "right",
           "mono": true,
           "decimals": 1
          },
          {
           "label": "From",
           "expr": "source",
           "align": "left",
           "mono": false,
           "decimals": 0
          },
          {
           "label": "Volume (µL)",
           "expr": "pipette_ul",
           "align": "right",
           "mono": true,
           "decimals": 2
          },
          {
           "label": "PBS (µL)",
           "expr": "buffer_ul",
           "align": "right",
           "mono": true,
           "decimals": 1
          }
         ]
        }
       }
      },
      {
       "kind": "calculator",
       "attrs": {
        "label": "Excluded-volume term",
        "inputs": [
         {
          "name": "c_nm",
          "label": "Free PE-antibody",
          "widget": "number",
          "unit": "nM",
          "default": 1
         },
         {
          "name": "v_excl",
          "label": "Bead volume inside the section",
          "widget": "number",
          "unit": "µm³",
          "default": 268,
          "rangeHint": "whole bead = 268 µm³ (upper bound)"
         }
        ],
        "outputs": [
         {
          "name": "excl_pe",
          "label": "Solution PE displaced by one bead",
          "expr": "c_nm * 0.6022 * v_excl",
          "unit": "PE",
          "decimals": 0
         }
        ],
        "table": {
         "dataset": "",
         "columns": []
        }
       }
      },
      {
       "kind": "callout",
       "body": "At [!var:c_nm] the bead displaces up to [!var:excl_pe] PE-equivalents of solution. Annulus subtraction removes that much too many, so a blank bead reads negative and a no-wash assay must add it back.",
       "attrs": {
        "type": "note"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "label": "Procedure",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "heading",
       "body": "Free PE-antibody",
       "attrs": {
        "code": "9a",
        "rule": true
       }
      },
      {
       "kind": "step",
       "body": "Make the working dilution ([!var:work_stock_ul] of stock into [!var:work_vol_ul]), then the six wells from the pipetting table. Add blank beads, settle 30 min."
      },
      {
       "kind": "step",
       "body": "Image each well in modes A–D of Exp 05 at operating settings, 3 fields each."
      },
      {
       "kind": "heading",
       "body": "Autofluorescence",
       "attrs": {
        "code": "9b",
        "rule": true
       }
      },
      {
       "kind": "step",
       "body": "Image ≥100 uncoated or blocked beads in PBS in the default mode."
      },
      {
       "kind": "heading",
       "body": "Nonspecific binding",
       "attrs": {
        "code": "9c",
        "rule": true
       }
      },
      {
       "kind": "step",
       "body": "Run the capture beads with PE-antibody at 0.5, 1, 2 and 5 × K_D2 and no analyte through the full assay (incubation, washes), 6 wells per level. Image ≥100 beads per well."
      },
      {
       "kind": "callout",
       "body": "Before any quantitative acquisition: stand and lasers on for 2–3 h; 561 nm excitation; the same PE emission band (e.g. 570–620 nm) every time; 16-bit with fine integration (the default is 12-bit, so check the file); one HV and one offset for the whole session; background mode at least 50 DN above zero; no saturated pixels. Record the transmitted-light channel with every PE frame: beads are found in it, never in PE. Find focus in transmitted light and hold it with Perfect Focus. Never live-scan PE to focus.",
       "attrs": {
        "type": "critical"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "label": "Analysis",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "step",
       "body": "9a: background per pixel (photoelectrons, Exp 02) against concentration gives a slope; with the photoelectrons per PE from Exp 10 it gives V_eff per mode. The blank-bead integrated signal against concentration gives the excluded-volume slope (expected negative)."
      },
      {
       "kind": "step",
       "body": "9b: autofluorescence per bead in PE-equivalents (after Exp 10)."
      },
      {
       "kind": "step",
       "body": "9c: PE per bead from nonspecific binding at each antibody level: mean, bead-to-bead SD and well-to-well SD. Practical LOD = blank + 3 SD of the well means. The level where the LOD stops improving sets D₀ (default 1–2 × K_D2)."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "label": "Decision & record",
     "children": [
      {
       "kind": "callout",
       "body": "Decision: washed versus no-wash format, which mode the no-wash read needs, and the detection-antibody concentration (9c).",
       "attrs": {
        "type": "note"
       }
      },
      {
       "kind": "table",
       "body": "Record for every acquisition",
       "attrs": {
        "columns": [
         {
          "key": "field",
          "label": "Field",
          "align": "left",
          "mono": false
         },
         {
          "key": "note",
          "label": "What to write",
          "align": "left",
          "mono": false
         }
        ],
        "rows": [
         {
          "field": "Well",
          "note": "Contents and free PE-Ab nM"
         },
         {
          "field": "Mode",
          "note": "A–D"
         },
         {
          "field": "Washed",
          "note": "Yes / no"
         },
         {
          "field": "Beads",
          "note": "Number analysed"
         }
        ]
       }
      },
      {
       "kind": "callout",
       "body": "Save the .nd2 files as acquired (no 8-bit export, no LUT) in a folder outside the website repo, e.g. BeadConfocalData/<date>_<exp>/, and fill one plate-map CSV row per well or field (columns are listed in Research/PE_bead_confocal_experiments.md, section 7).",
       "attrs": {
        "type": "note"
       }
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 }
}
